abstract: >-
  An MCP (Model Context Protocol) server exposing live Deutsche Bahn timetable
  data to language-model assistants: journey planning with fare breakdown,
  cheapest-time-of-day search, departure and arrival boards with real-time
  delays and platform changes, per-train stop lists, coach sequence, and
  station geosearch. It queries the JSON endpoints behind bahn.de directly,
  requires no API key, and is tested against recorded and live responses.
